  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained rises in Gulf regional tension draw US/NATO naval and air assets and intelligence focus to the Middle East, reducing immediate Western surveillance and rapid-response presence in the Black Sea/Eastern Europe and encouraging Russia to increase hybrid actions (cyber, sabotage, legal/administrative pressure) against Ukrainian targets to exploit the attention gap.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
