  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Prolonged reductions in export volumes that drive local economic dislocation and commodity shortages provide focal issues for partisan actors to assign blame and mobilize opposed constituencies, increasing polarization.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">mid_east_gulf_disruption</data>
  <data key="d39">alliance_reliability_shi</data>
