  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">New or tightened export controls produce immediate business and partner harm that prompts affected firms and foreign counterparties to file lawsuits, injunctions and trade complaints to block or delay measures, raising litigation frequency.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
