  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter export controls on critical technologies raise compliance costs and legal risk for cross‑border deals and force delays/terminations of investments and licensing, directly reducing net cross‑border capital and portfolio flows.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
