  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A decline in cross‑border capital inflows reduces demand for sovereign debt and forces domestic borrowers to tap more expensive marginal financing, directly widening sovereign credit spreads versus benchmarks.</data>
