  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater trade and regulatory fragmentation raises sanction/port-denial risk, insurance costs and paperwork for vessels and terminals handling Russian fuel, producing rerouting, slower transits and reduced effective pipeline/terminal throughput for diesel shipments.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_escalatio</data>
